            "review_title": "Review at Le Gia 1 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Derek Lee\nHong Kong, China134 contributions\n0\nDon't believe the internet.\nAug 2024 • Family\nService was poor but I will put it down to cultural difference. I have noticed numerous places in Da Nang as having poor or bad service.\n\nThe food was rather average at best but reasonably priced. The place was rather empty the night we visited and the restaurant lacked air con except the \"VIP\" rooms.\n\nIf I was guessing, the restaurant was not just serving food but also extra services based on the different young girls being selected by \"VIPs\" to join dinner.\n\nI cannot possibly recommend this restaurant and I cannot figure whether its the poor service, hot summer night with no aircon or an establishment that is beyond F&B.\nRead more\nWritten August 2, 2024",
